{
  "key": 19952,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "…Hm? A visitor.\r",
        "Most people walk right past this\n",
        "house. Their loss.\r",
        "The name’s Rod. Grandmaster of the\n",
        "Pokémon Trading Card Game.\r",
        "You battle with real Pokémon, right?\n",
        "Cute. I respect it.\r",
        "But out here on the table, it’s all\n",
        "you. Sixty cards. Six Prizes.\f",
        "Every draw is a choice you own.\r",
        "No luck in the world beats a deck\n",
        "that’s built with heart.\r",
        "…Sorry. I get carried away.\n",
        "This game is kind of my whole life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_WantToDuel",
      "en_US": [
        "So. Think you can take a Prize card\n",
        "off me? Want to duel?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_WantToDuelAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Rod: Back for more?\n",
        "Good. The cards remember you.\r",
        "Want to duel?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_ChooseDeck",
      "en_US": [
        "Pick a deck from my collection.\n",
        "Every one of them is a classic.\r",
        "And if you want out, press B at\n",
        "the duel menu to give up. It counts\f",
        "as a loss, though."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckGrass",
      "en_US": "Flower Power"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckFire",
      "en_US": "Fire Charge"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckWater",
      "en_US": "Go Go Rain Dance"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckLightning",
      "en_US": "Zapping Selfdestruct"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckPsychic",
      "en_US": "Strange Psyshock"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckFighting",
      "en_US": "First-Strike"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_cv_more",
      "en_US": "More…"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_DeckColorless",
      "en_US": "Colorless"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_LetsDuel",
      "en_US": [
        "Nice pick. Shuffle up.\r",
        "I’ll be playing my Legendary\n",
        "Dragonite deck. Don’t hold back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_YouWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Rod: …Heh. You actually did it.\r",
        "Haven’t had a duel like that in a\n",
        "long time. That was fun. Seriously.\r",
        "Here. A winner keeps one of the\n",
        "deck’s Energy cards. House rule."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_AboutEnergy",
      "en_US": [
        "Those Energy cards aren’t just\n",
        "paper, either.\r",
        "Use one on a Pokémon and it powers\n",
        "up one of its moves for good.\r",
        "Win again, and I’ll hand over\n",
        "another. I’m always up for a duel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_Declined",
      "en_US": [
        "Rod: No rush.\n",
        "The table’s not going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_SaffronCity_TcgHouse_Text_YouLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Rod: Good game. Really.\r",
        "You’ve got the instincts. Now just\n",
        "learn to trust your deck.\r",
        "Come back whenever you want a\n",
        "rematch. I’ll be right here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0965_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_TCG_HOUSE_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
